R8c0_rms_warp_strided_groups kernel=fused_rmsnorm_mq_rotate lever=rms_warp_strided_groups verdict=DEAD delta_pct=0.0 f=0.531 learned=The gfx1100 warp-stride loop preserved parity and cut VGPR 48->40 but decode stayed flat because achieved occ remained catastrophically pinned at 0.1%; with L2-hit 29.1% and mem_busy 10.3%, per-wave control/address latency is not the limiter and this single-block kernel needs structural extra wave-level work or launch parallelism.
