R16c0_gdn_lb16 kernel=gated_delta_net_q8_fast lever=gdn_lb16 verdict=DEAD delta_pct=0.14 f=0.606 learned=Raising the gfx1100 waves-per-EU launch bound from 8 to 16 preserved exact parity but did not change VGPR=64 and reduced achieved occupancy from the 16.5% BOD baseline to 14.7%; despite mem_busy rising 31.8%->40.2%, decode stayed flat, so the compiler could not expose additional resident-wave TLP through this constraint and launch-bounds pressure is not a productive lever here.
